# scripts/opcount: `jsonparse check` parses the JSON document of N records
# that `jsonparse gen -seed 1 -n N` writes and counts its values; the cost
# of one record is the slope between the two sizes. The control is the
# hand Go parser of the same design.
unit record
sizes 20000 160000
input self gen -seed 1 -n {n}
args check {input}
control cmd/ergo/testdata/jsonparse/control
